Z||000000||BAM-BAM||02-08-2001||11:29 PM||||  The title says it all. I'm outta here. I've had enough for a while, time to kick it somewhere else. To those of you on the Forum who have been helpfull (and there's alot of you) thanks for everything. I have made quite a few Forum friends that I feel are genuinely good people and you know who you are; Jeff K., Mike V., FieroDave, Oreif, Mr. Stillwell (the young one), Brian B., The Monk, and many more. You all are assets to this Forum and I have gained alot from all your help help and shared knowledge. You guys have been role modles for me. Thanks!<BR>  To the rest of you, good luck on all your endeavors as they relate to your Fiero's and life in general. This is without a doubt the greatest place on the net. I leave with no hard feelings, I just need to slide for a while. <BR>  Cliff, if you would please, close this thread. Thank you  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach/KYB Susp.<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats,headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Gauges And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||6
